[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    286[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    287[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    288[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Phase B/C: fgets' 99-byte limit, exercised one byte at a time around the
